- Includes full extension ball bearing top and bottom mount glides for stable operation.
- Maple TSCA compliant plywood construction with a durable polyurethane clear topcoat.
- Units can be easily installed between either framed or full access base cabinets, including Conestoga's Advantage and Vesta RTA lines.

