Joplin (17N)", "Roble Stella (74V)" ], "Face Width": "4-1/16\" to 8\"", "Price": "$128.00" } ] }
TTS Scribe Moulding (Intrigue, Strata and Vogue) - Intrigue Scribe Moulding is 3/8" thick x 3/4" wide x 96" long. - Intrigue Scribe is manufactured utilizing 19mm edgebanded panels edgebanded on the face and both short edges of the moulding, while the two 3/8” thick long edges are the matching TFL board surface. The back of the moulding is uncoated for installation. - Intrigue Scribe Mouldings are shipped with an additional support piece to provide reinforced stability throughout the delivery process. - Strata & Vogue Scribe Moulding is 8mm thick x 1-1/4" wide x 96" long. Strata, Vogue - Strata & Vogue Scribe is manufactured utilizing edgebanded 8mm material, banded on one long edge and both short edges with matching edgeband. 8mm - Moulding Cut-Down Option is available, but will remove one short edgebanded end. - Sold in pairs – no option.
