All plywood panel designs use a veneered, composite core panel. All plywood panels except Red and White Birch, Quarter Sawn and Rift Cut White Oak use a plain sliced or half round face and plain sliced or rotary back veneer. Red and White Birch use a rotary face and back. Quarter Sawn White Oak uses a quarter sawn face and plain sliced back. ¾” thick Rift Cut White Oak panels use rift cut on face and back. All other Rift Cut plywood uses rift cut veneer on face, plain slice on back. Horizontal grain direction standard unless otherwise noted; vertical grain available upon request.

