All plywood panel designs use a veneered, composite core panel. All plywood panels except Red and White Birch and Quarter Sawn and Rift White Oak use a plain sliced or half round face and plain sliced or rotary back veneer. Red and White Birch use a rotary face and back. Quarter Sawn White Oak uses a quarter sawn face and plain sliced back. Rift Cut White Oak uses a rift cut face and plain sliced back. Horizontal grain direction standard unless otherwise noted; vertical grain available upon request. Minimums listed are based on panel raise shown and will vary by raise; see Offering and Availability for additional options. Framing width listed is determined by measuring across the back of the framing unless otherwise noted.

