    },
    {
      "material": "Maple, Hard",
      "astoria_savoy_sqft_min": "$19.90"
    },
    {
      "material": "Oak, White, Rift Cut",
      "astoria_savoy_sqft_min": "$28.70"
    },
    {
      "material": "Walnut",
      "astoria_savoy_sqft_min": "$26.60"
    }
  ],
  "ordering_instructions": [
    "To achieve Sequential Grain Matching, all corresponding doors and drawer fronts will be cut from an oversized blank.",
    "Doors and drawer fronts requiring Sequential Grain Matching must be ordered using Conestoga's Sequential Grain Matching (SGM) Templates and Order Form #2 to identify the specific cabinet configuration, position and sequence of the individual pieces within a cabinet. Templates for cabinet configurations from 2 - 6 pieces.",
    "Select the appropriate SGM template number from PDF that matches your cabinet configuration. Indicate the grain direction of your doors and drawer fronts (vertical or horizontal).",
    "Following the alpha sequence of the template, enter your doors and drawer fronts in positions A, B, C etc., width x height.",
    "Indicate whether each piece is being used as a door or a drawer front.",
    "Specify concealed hinge boring and grain direction, as well as any special instructions in the notes section."
