      "Open Credit Terms": [
        "Customers with open credit terms will be shipped prepaid via common carriers. A \"freight only\" invoice will be generated per delivery. Rates vary by zone and weight.",
        "All orders that ship via Conestoga route truck service will be consolidated and one \"freight only\" invoice will be generated per delivery. Rates vary by zone and weight.",
        "FedEx Ground and UPS Ground will be shipped prepaid and the charges will be added to each invoice."
      ],
      "100% Prepay": [
        "Customers will be charged for shipping at the time the order is placed.",
        "Conestoga will estimate the weight of the order and utilize a zone freight matrix to determine freight charges."
      ]
