      "Handling Fee": [
        "A 2.5% handling fee (min. $10.00 net) is added to all customer pickup orders due to staging, storage and double handling of the product. All customer pick-ups must be scheduled through Customer Service at least four business hours prior to the desired pickup time. Customers picking up their own orders are asked to do so within three days of the acknowledged ship date."
      ],
      "Warehouse Hours": "Warehouse hours of operation are 7:00 a.m. - 3:30 p.m. (EST), Monday through Friday."
